  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Recuperacin y Desarrollo Urbano de Valparaso</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Renewal and Development Valparaiso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Programa tiene el objetivo de apoyar la reactivacin econmica de la ciudad de Valparaso en beneficio de su poblacin, a travs de (i) actividades dirigidas a la restauracin y preservacin del patrimonio urbano histrico y cultural de la ciudad, as como de (ii) otras actividades que aprovechen las caractersticas ventajosas de la ciudad, como son su ubicacin costera y la presencia de un sector universitario importante.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program has the objective of supporting the economic reactivation of Valparaiso city for the benefit of its population, by financing activities directed towards: (i) the restoration and preservation of the urban historic and cultural heritage of the city, as well (ii) enabling the city to make the best use its advantageous characteristics, such as its seaside location and the presence of a large number of important universities.</narrative>
  </description>
